      "message": "[Gerrit AI Review] ❌ **Changes Requested**\n\n`convert_rts_snr_init_error_code` returns a positive bitflag (e.g., `FINGERPRINT_ERROR_INIT_FAIL` / `BIT(15)`). Returning this positive value from `rts5817maa_init` violates the Zephyr API contract for device initialization, which expects `0` for success or a **negative** error code (like `-EIO` or `-ENODEV`). Zephyr`s device initialization sequence treats positive return values as success!\n\nPlease return a standard negative error code (like `-EIO`) while still setting the `data-\u003eerrors` state correctly:\n\n```c\n\tif (ret) {\n\t\tLOG_ERR(\"sensor init failed %d\", ret);\n\t\tdata-\u003eerrors |\u003d (ret | FINGERPRINT_ERROR_INIT_FAIL);\n\t\treturn -EIO;\n\t}\n```\n\n[🔗](http://go/tj/6f389ceb-7f03-4dd0-925a-d102091adef7)",
